        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Gideoni n'abashaija igana abu yaabaire aine baahika ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, abantu baahirwayo, ahu abarinzi ba kabiri batandikira; baateera enzamba, baayata enyungu ezi baabaire baine omu ngaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo mitwe eshatu y'engabo baateerera hamwe enzamba, baayata enyungu, bakwaitse emuri omu ngaro zaabo za bumosho, n'enzamba z'okuteera ziri omu za buryo; baateera orwari nibagira bati: Rurara ya MUKAMA n'eya Gideoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
