              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gideoni yaatuma entumwa omu nsi yoona ey'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, naagira ati: Mushuume, murwanise Abamidiani, mubatangire aha maizi okuhika Besi-baara, n'aha mugyera Yorudani. Batyo abashaija boona aba Efuraimu baahurura, baakwata amaizi goona okuhika Besi-baara, n'omugyera Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
