        {
          "text": " Kandi baakwata abanyiginya babiri ba Midiani, Orebu na Zeebu; Orebu baamwitira aha rukiri rwa Orebu, na Zeebu baamwitira aha inyuukiro rya Zeebu; baagumizamu baakurata Abamidiani; kandi baareetera Gideoni omutwe gwa Orebu n'ogwa Zeebu seeri ya Yorudani.",
